  {
    "name": "SharePass生命周期(创建/check/查规则ID/编辑/删除) - instacart",
    "description": "单接口测试：串联 POST /sharePass/create → POST /sharePass/check → POST /sharePass/getRuleIdsFromSharePass → POST /sharePass/edit → POST /sharePass/delete。该链路ES近90天在instacart平台均无可用样本(create/check/getRuleIdsFromSharePass/edit均0次)，全平台合计分别为60/62/35/2次真实调用；create真实body结构为{productLine,clientId,timeZone,targetType,list:[{templateId,type}],userId}(即使targetType=rule，条目字段名仍为templateId，全平台93%样本type=1)，按该已验证真实结构使用instacart测试账号真实rule({{real_rule_id}}，真实Campaign类型规则)构造targetType=rule的SharePass创建，第2步起使用创建返回的真实sharePassId串联check/getRuleIdsFromSharePass/edit，最后一步删除清理，保证用例可重复执行。instacart平台。",
    "module": "share-pass-controller",
    "granularity": "API",
    "since": "init",
    "last_modified": "init",
    "change_type": "NEW",
    "generated_by": "swagger-api-case",
    "steps": [
      {
        "name": "创建SharePass",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{RULEBASEURL}}",
        "path": "/sharePass/create",
        "request_body": {
          "productLine": "instacart",
          "clientId": "{{client_id}}",
          "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles",
          "targetType": "rule",
          "list": [
            {
              "templateId": "{{real_rule_id}}",
              "type": 1
            }
          ],
          "userId": "{{user_id}}"
        },
        "extract_vars": {
          "created_share_pass_id": "data[0]"
        },
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "data": {
            "$not_empty": true
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "check SharePass",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{RULEBASEURL}}",
        "path": "/sharePass/check",
        "request_body": {
          "clientId": "{{client_id}}",
          "sharePassId": "{{created_share_pass_id}}",
          "targetProductLine": "instacart"
        },
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "查询SharePass关联规则ID",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{RULEBASEURL}}",
        "path": "/sharePass/getRuleIdsFromSharePass",
        "request_body": {
          "clientId": "{{client_id}}",
          "sharePassId": "{{created_share_pass_id}}"
        },
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "编辑SharePass状态",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{RULEBASEURL}}",
        "path": "/sharePass/edit",
        "request_body": {
          "sharePassId": "{{created_share_pass_id}}",
          "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles",
          "status": "Inactive"
        },
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "清理-删除SharePass",
